abstract: "Hardware-agnostic, multi-physics control and scheduling simulation suite (v5-v12) for precision Split-Z multi-path lithographic etching, pairing coarse substrate datum positioning with fast per-path focus and attitude trimming across four disjoint active quadrants on a circular substrate."
